Package: hope-halo
Version: 0.1.0-alpha
Section: admin
Priority: required
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends},
         systemd,
         systemd-sysv,
         sudo,
         dbus,
         udev,
         libudev1,
         librsutil0.3,
         libsqlite3-0,
         libssl3,
         librust-libudev-dev
Maintainer: Hope OS Team <dev@hope-os.org>
Description: Hope OS Hardware Adaptation Layer (HAL+)
 Rust daemon for hardware detection and driver management.
 .
 HAL+ features:
  - Automatic device detection via udev
  - Vendor:product ID lookup in local SQLite database
  - Cloud sync for unknown devices (nightly)
  - Notification system with simple UI (1 question, 3 buttons max)
  - No jargon in user communications
  - Kernel module loading and driver installation
  - Bitwarden / KeePassXC / vaultwarden integration
  - Privacy-first: local-first processing
 .
 This package is part of Hope OS.
Homepage: https://hope-os.org
